GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_InstallableExpertise> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_InstallableExpertise> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstallableExpertise> ;
    narr:childCount "21"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "3d701e5703aa3f959ba54d59603077ba4a8ce3db" ;
    narr:narration """The arc opens with [the renaming from memory to installable expertise](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24), grounds itself in [the citable-perspective moat claim](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_26), and extends through [the rhetorical framing of the target expert market](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_28) and [the delegation-of-expertise use case](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_30), capped by [the Apple-not-toolbox platform ambition](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_32). A later thread grounds that thesis in a live beta: [a user classified as a Knowledge Packager](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_38), a type [structurally identical to another packager's profile](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_37) though [differing on other axes](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_41). Her actual onboarding surfaces friction the thesis doesn't narrate: [the moment named when users freeze after connecting a tool](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_58), [a prescription for plainer script language as the fix](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_60), and [backend concepts described as entirely foreign](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63). A related [feedback-capture gap from an earlier onboarding call](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_55) and [the open question of how post-install UX should guide non-technical users](narr:Position_OnboardingToolPromptGuidance) sit downstream of this same tension.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_26> ;
